_review/GRAMMAR_REVIEW.md:11:**LL(1) status.** The expression and declaration kernels below are factored for predictive parsing. There are unresolved surface choices, especially statement/value blocks and contextual words. This is not a claim that a complete grammar has passed a mechanical LL(1) check. Section 8 identifies the remaining conflicts and the decisions needed; it would be false to promise a fully checked LL(1) grammar before those choices are approved. No decided spelling is changed to hide a conflict.
