legacy/docs/spec/modules.md:71:### MOD-2. Only `pub` declarations cross a module boundary
legacy/docs/spec/modules.md:73:**MOD-2@1.** A declaration is private to its module unless it is declared `pub`, and another module uses it only by importing it from a module that exists, where it is `pub`.
