legacy/docs/spec/modules.md:488:### MOD-9. An import binds the declaration it names
legacy/docs/spec/modules.md:490:**MOD-9@2.** Importing a `pub` function, foreign binding, struct, enum, trait, type alias or constant binds that declaration itself, and an import alias of a struct or enum names the same type, with its methods and impls, in every pass.
legacy/docs/spec/modules.md:501:**Rationale.** A public trait is explicitly exported and imported like other declarations (owner, 2026-11-02); aliases preserve declaration identity, and removed newtypes introduce none.
